					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="639" height="898" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Macys-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-November-2026-Sales-Deals-List.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Macy&#039;s US LEGO Black Friday November 2026 Sales &amp; Deals List" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Macys-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-November-2026-Sales-Deals-List.jpg 639w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Macys-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-November-2026-Sales-Deals-List-213x300.jpg 213w" sizes="(max-width: 639px) 100vw, 639px" loading="lazy" /></p>
<p>Macy&#8217;s US Online has started their LEGO Black Friday Deals for November 2026! They have over 120 LEGO</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/us-macys-lego-black-friday-november-2026-deals-now-live-over-120-sets-discounted/">[US] Macy&#8217;s LEGO Black Friday November 2026 Deals Now Live: Over 120 Sets Discounted</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://www.jdoqocy.com/click-5112601-15578706?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.macys.com%2Fshop%2Fsearch%3Fkeyword%3Dlego" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Macy&#8217;s US Online</a> has started their LEGO Black Friday Deals for November 2026! They have over <a href="https://www.kqzyfj.com/click-5112601-17381743?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.macys.com%2Fshop%2Fsale%2Fblack-friday-deals%2Fkids-baby%2FBrand%2CSortby%2FLego%257CLEGO%25C2%25AE%2CPRICE_HIGH_TO_LOW%3Fid%3D385467%26cm_re%3D2026.11.14-_-homepage_include_1_row_01-_-hs%3Aevent-black-friday-sale-kids-and-toys" target="_blank" rel="noopener">120 LEGO sets on sale and discounted</a>. Most of the deals are around 20% off but there are a few that are 30-40% off (very limited items at these discounts though).</p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get LEGO news, new product updates, sales &amp; deals updates, creations and reviews right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates. </span></p>
<p><a href="https://www.kqzyfj.com/click-5112601-17381743?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.macys.com%2Fshop%2Fsale%2Fblack-friday-deals%2Fkids-baby%2FBrand%2CSortby%2FLego%257CLEGO%25C2%25AE%2CPRICE_HIGH_TO_LOW%3Fid%3D385467%26cm_re%3D2026.11.14-_-homepage_include_1_row_01-_-hs%3Aevent-black-friday-sale-kids-and-toys" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114757 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Macys-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-November-2026-Sales-Deals-List.jpg" alt="" width="639" height="898" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Macys-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-November-2026-Sales-Deals-List.jpg 639w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Macys-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-November-2026-Sales-Deals-List-213x300.jpg 213w" sizes="(max-width: 639px) 100vw, 639px" /></a></p>
<p>My top pick would probably be the <a href="https://www.anrdoezrs.net/click-5112601-17381743?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.macys.com%2Fshop%2Fproduct%2Flego-star-wars-the-razor-crest-75447-building-toy-930-pieces%3FID%3D26415590%23BRAND%2CSORTBY%2FLego%7CLEGO%25C2%25AE%2CPRICE_HIGH_TO_LOW" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Star Wars 75447 The Razor Crest</a> for <strong>$119.99</strong> (reg.$149.99). Savings work out to be 20% off.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.anrdoezrs.net/click-5112601-17381743?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.macys.com%2Fshop%2Fproduct%2Flego-star-wars-the-razor-crest-75447-building-toy-930-pieces%3FID%3D26415590%23BRAND%2CSORTBY%2FLego%7CLEGO%25C2%25AE%2CPRICE_HIGH_TO_LOW" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-104983 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGO-Star-Wars-75447-The-Razor-Crest-April-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="859" height="863" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGO-Star-Wars-75447-The-Razor-Crest-April-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 859w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGO-Star-Wars-75447-The-Razor-Crest-April-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGO-Star-Wars-75447-The-Razor-Crest-April-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGO-Star-Wars-75447-The-Razor-Crest-April-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x772.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 859px) 100vw, 859px" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://www.anrdoezrs.net/click-5112601-17381743?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.macys.com%2Fshop%2Fproduct%2Flego-star-wars-the-razor-crest-75447-building-toy-930-pieces%3FID%3D26415590%23BRAND%2CSORTBY%2FLego%7CLEGO%25C2%25AE%2CPRICE_HIGH_TO_LOW" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-104984 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGO-Star-Wars-75447-The-Razor-Crest-April-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="971" height="869" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGO-Star-Wars-75447-The-Razor-Crest-April-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg 971w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGO-Star-Wars-75447-The-Razor-Crest-April-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-300x268.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGO-Star-Wars-75447-The-Razor-Crest-April-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x687.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 971px) 100vw, 971px" /></a></p>
<p>We also have a<strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Sales Page Hub</a></strong> too. The <strong>page is updated regularly</strong> so that you don&#8217;t miss out on any bargains. For more <strong>LEGO Sales Finds submitted by Toys N Bricks forum members</strong>, you can <a href="https://www.toysnbricksforum.com/index.php?/forum/17-general-lego-sales-deals-forum-members-only/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">visit our LEGO Sales &amp; Deals forum section</a>. Registration for a forum membership account is<strong> free and fast</strong>.</p>
<p><strong>More LEGO reads at Toys N Bricks:</strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-news/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO News</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/legoland-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-reviews/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Reviews</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Deals</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-canada/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada LEGO Deals</a></p>
<p><strong>Visit our LEGO Forums:</strong> Where traditional and classic meets our <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Legacy LEGO Forums</a>. A library of LEGO resources and for members to ask questions. All articles posted on our main site at Toysnbricks.com are posted in the forums as well. The best part is that there are no ads in our LEGO forums. Registration for a basic forum account is free and fast.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113380 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="730" height="583" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg 999w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-300x240.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-768x613.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 730px) 100vw, 730px" /></p>
<p>Disclosure Integrity &amp; Transparency: This post contains affiliate links. Toys N Bricks earns from qualifying purchases. <em>Please ensure to accept the merchant’s 3rd party cookies (if there are any) and disable any 3rd party extensions (if there are any) so that the affiliate link tracking works. </em>Thank you for your support in the work that we do here.</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/us-macys-lego-black-friday-november-2026-deals-now-live-over-120-sets-discounted/">[US] Macy&#8217;s LEGO Black Friday November 2026 Deals Now Live: Over 120 Sets Discounted</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
