		<item>
		<title>[US] Target Up to 30% off Select LEGO (Choose from Over 180 LEGO Sets): November 2026 Sale</title>
		<link>https://www.toysnbricks.com/us-target-up-to-30-off-select-lego-choose-from-over-180-lego-sets-november-2026-sale/</link>
					<comments>https://www.toysnbricks.com/us-target-up-to-30-off-select-lego-choose-from-over-180-lego-sets-november-2026-sale/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Ice]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 02:25:24 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[General]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO Sales & Deals]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO Sales US]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.toysnbricks.com/?p=114745</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="628" height="907" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-LEGO-November-13-2026-Sales-Deals-List.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Target US LEGO November 13, 2026 Sales &amp; Deals List" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-LEGO-November-13-2026-Sales-Deals-List.jpg 628w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-LEGO-November-13-2026-Sales-Deals-List-208x300.jpg 208w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 628px) 100vw, 628px" /></p>
<p>Target US is currently offering up to 30% off select LEGO. There are 191 LEGO items to choose</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/us-target-up-to-30-off-select-lego-choose-from-over-180-lego-sets-november-2026-sale/">[US] Target Up to 30% off Select LEGO (Choose from Over 180 LEGO Sets): November 2026 Sale</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://howl.link/r2papearnsh7k" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114746 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-LEGO-Up-to-30-off-Sales-Deals-November-13-2026.jpg" alt="" width="819" height="494" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-LEGO-Up-to-30-off-Sales-Deals-November-13-2026.jpg 819w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-LEGO-Up-to-30-off-Sales-Deals-November-13-2026-300x181.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-LEGO-Up-to-30-off-Sales-Deals-November-13-2026-768x463.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 819px) 100vw, 819px" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://howl.link/vdtrq2gdiozih" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Target US</a> is currently offering up to 30% off select LEGO. There are <a href="https://howl.link/r2papearnsh7k" target="_blank" rel="noopener">191 LEGO items to choose from</a>. Note that some of the regular prices are lower at <a href="https://howl.link/vdtrq2gdiozih" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Target US</a> compared to  <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO USA</a>. As such, you may end up saving even more than 30% off.</p>
<p><a href="https://howl.link/r2papearnsh7k" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114748 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-LEGO-November-13-2026-Sales-Deals-List-2.jpg" alt="" width="605" height="907" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-LEGO-November-13-2026-Sales-Deals-List-2.jpg 605w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-LEGO-November-13-2026-Sales-Deals-List-2-200x300.jpg 200w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 605px) 100vw, 605px" /></a></p>
<p>My top pick would probably be the <a href="https://howl.link/gc57ykgx2ic1f" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Harry Potter Privet Drive: Aunt Marge’s Visit 76451</a> at 43% off for <strong>$50.99</strong> (reg.$89.99). Note that this set is listed as sold out on <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO USA</a>.</p>
<p><a href="https://howl.link/gc57ykgx2ic1f" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-96580 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76451-Privet-Drive-Aunt-Marges-Visit-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="866" height="862" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76451-Privet-Drive-Aunt-Marges-Visit-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 866w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76451-Privet-Drive-Aunt-Marges-Visit-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76451-Privet-Drive-Aunt-Marges-Visit-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76451-Privet-Drive-Aunt-Marges-Visit-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x764.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 866px) 100vw, 866px" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://howl.link/gc57ykgx2ic1f" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-96581 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76451-Privet-Drive-Aunt-Marges-Visit-June-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="930" height="736" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76451-Privet-Drive-Aunt-Marges-Visit-June-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg 930w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76451-Privet-Drive-Aunt-Marges-Visit-June-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box-300x237.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76451-Privet-Drive-Aunt-Marges-Visit-June-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x608.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 930px) 100vw, 930px" /></a></p>
<p>Free shipping on orders above $35 at <a href="https://howl.link/vdtrq2gdiozih" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Target.com US</a>.<strong> If you have a Target Circle Card, you&#8217;ll save an extra 5% off as well (on top of discounted prices).</strong></p>
<p><a href="https://howl.link/r2papearnsh7k" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114747 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-LEGO-November-13-2026-Sales-Deals-List.jpg" alt="" width="628" height="907" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-LEGO-November-13-2026-Sales-Deals-List.jpg 628w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-LEGO-November-13-2026-Sales-Deals-List-208x300.jpg 208w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 628px) 100vw, 628px" /></a></p>
<p>Keep it lock to Toys N Bricks and we&#8217;ll update you when we have more LEGO Sales &amp; Deals USA offers!</p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get LEGO news, new product updates, sales &amp; deals updates, creations and reviews right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates. </span></p>
<p>We also have a<strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Sales Page Hub</a></strong> too. The <strong>page is updated regularly</strong> so that you don&#8217;t miss out on any bargains. For more <strong>LEGO Sales Finds submitted by Toys N Bricks forum members</strong>, you can <a href="https://toysnbricks.com/forum/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">visit our LEGO Sales &amp; Deals forum section</a>. Registration for a forum membership account is<strong> free and fast</strong>.</p>
<p><strong>More LEGO reads at Toys N Bricks:</strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-news/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO News</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/legoland-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-reviews/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Reviews</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Deals</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-canada/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada LEGO Deals</a></p>
<p><strong>Visit our LEGO Forums:</strong> Where traditional and classic meets our <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Legacy LEGO Forums</a>. A library of LEGO resources and for members to ask questions. All articles posted on our main site at Toysnbricks.com are posted in the forums as well. The best part is that there are no ads in our LEGO forums. Registration for a basic forum account is free and fast.</p>
