					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="846" height="727" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/18-LEGO-72423-Shrek-Donkey-Puss-in-Boots-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="18+ LEGO 72423 Shrek, Donkey &amp; Puss in Boots June 2026 Release Date Front Box" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/18-LEGO-72423-Shrek-Donkey-Puss-in-Boots-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 846w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/18-LEGO-72423-Shrek-Donkey-Puss-in-Boots-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x258.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/18-LEGO-72423-Shrek-Donkey-Puss-in-Boots-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x660.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 846px) 100vw, 846px" /></p>
<p>Good Afternoon LEGO Fans! Amazon US currently has some LEGO deals for today. Free shipping on orders above</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/8-handpicked-best-amazon-us-lego-deals-sales-list-for-this-afternoon-november-13-2026/">8 Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &#038; Sales List for This Afternoon, November 13, 2026</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Good Afternoon LEGO Fans! <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> currently has some LEGO deals for today. Free shipping on orders above $35. As always, prices can fluctuate at anytime.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-107003 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/18-LEGO-72423-Shrek-Donkey-Puss-in-Boots-June-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-9.jpg" alt="" width="991" height="658" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/18-LEGO-72423-Shrek-Donkey-Puss-in-Boots-June-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-9.jpg 991w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/18-LEGO-72423-Shrek-Donkey-Puss-in-Boots-June-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-9-300x199.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/18-LEGO-72423-Shrek-Donkey-Puss-in-Boots-June-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-9-768x510.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 991px) 100vw, 991px" /></p>
<p>My favorite deals include <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-6589442-TBD-Minifigures-66815/dp/B0G5QKTYPR?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=994e6fe8f2a67d5947922379f9ecdb39&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Minifigures Shrek Series 6-Pack 66815</a> at 20% off for <strong>$24</strong> (reg.$29.94). You also can&#8217;t go wrong with the <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-TBD-B-2026-72423/dp/B0G2T2471K?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=f4e23688c1b556928a558e06ef90708e&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">18+ LEGO Shrek: Shrek, Donkey &amp; Puss in Boots 72423</a> at 20% off for <strong>$103.95</strong> (reg.$129.99). This set <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Batman-Tumbler-Two-Face-Building/dp/B0DJ199X9Z?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=d4976819f38bfdc08f0e6ca87605c647&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO DC Batman Tumbler vs. Two-Face &amp; The Joker 76303</a> at 20% off for <strong>$47.99</strong> (reg.$59.99) is pretty good too.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-93018 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/LEGO-DC-76303-Batman-Tumbler-vs.-Two-Face-The-Joker-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="854" height="841" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/LEGO-DC-76303-Batman-Tumbler-vs.-Two-Face-The-Joker-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 854w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/LEGO-DC-76303-Batman-Tumbler-vs.-Two-Face-The-Joker-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x295.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/LEGO-DC-76303-Batman-Tumbler-vs.-Two-Face-The-Joker-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x756.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 854px) 100vw, 854px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-111201 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-71053-Shrek-Series-CMF-Collectable-Minifigures-September-2026-Release-Date-Packaging-Box.png" alt="" width="946" height="946" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-71053-Shrek-Series-CMF-Collectable-Minifigures-September-2026-Release-Date-Packaging-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-71053-Shrek-Series-CMF-Collectable-Minifigures-September-2026-Release-Date-Packaging-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-71053-Shrek-Series-CMF-Collectable-Minifigures-September-2026-Release-Date-Packaging-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-71053-Shrek-Series-CMF-Collectable-Minifigures-September-2026-Release-Date-Packaging-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-71053-Shrek-Series-CMF-Collectable-Minifigures-September-2026-Release-Date-Packaging-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 946px) 100vw, 946px" /></p>
<p>Below are 8 of our Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for This Afternoon, November 13, 2026.  Be sure to subscribe to our email so you don’t miss out on any other LEGO Sales &amp; Deals happening in the USA!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
