										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wal-Mart Canada Online</a> currently has a few LEGO deals for this afternoon for November 13, 2026. My favourite deal (and especially for the Holiday Christmas season) would be the LEGO Star Wars Gingerbread AT-AT Walker 40806 at $59.88 (reg.$79.99). This is a very popular set when it was first released and I&#8217;m sure LEGO Star Wars fans would definitely enjoy this toy kit. I also listed a few more deals further below as well.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-99915 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/LEGO-Star-Wars-40806-Gingerbread-AT-AT-Walker-October-2025-Release-Date-Christmas-2025-Set-Lifestyle-22.jpg" alt="" width="992" height="634" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/LEGO-Star-Wars-40806-Gingerbread-AT-AT-Walker-October-2025-Release-Date-Christmas-2025-Set-Lifestyle-22.jpg 992w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/LEGO-Star-Wars-40806-Gingerbread-AT-AT-Walker-October-2025-Release-Date-Christmas-2025-Set-Lifestyle-22-300x192.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/LEGO-Star-Wars-40806-Gingerbread-AT-AT-Walker-October-2025-Release-Date-Christmas-2025-Set-Lifestyle-22-768x491.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 992px) 100vw, 992px" /></p>
<p>Note that <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wal-Mart Canada</a> did not list the regular price for a few of the sets. But we did check them with <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Canada</a> and calculated the actual savings percentage for your convenience. Free shipping on orders above $35 for items sold by Wal-Mart Canada (free shipping not available for remote areas or for orders over 150lbs).</p>
<p>Don&#8217;t miss out on any future LEGO Sales &amp; Deals happening in Canada by subscribing to our email list!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">4 Handpicked Best Wal-Mart Canada LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for Today, November 13, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li>25% off &#8211; LEGO Star Wars Gingerbread AT-AT Walker 40806 <strong>$59.98</strong> (reg.$79.99) &#8211; <em>Regular retail price is $79.99 at <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Canada</a></em></li>
<li>20% off &#8211; LEGO Star Wars AT-RT Attack 75444<strong> $47.88</strong> (reg.$59.99) &#8211; <em>Regular retail price is $59.99 at <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Canada</a></em></li>
<li><strong>Shop Now:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wal-Mart Canada Online</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-99911 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/LEGO-Star-Wars-40806-Gingerbread-AT-AT-Walker-October-2025-Release-Date-Christmas-2025-Set-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="847" height="852" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/LEGO-Star-Wars-40806-Gingerbread-AT-AT-Walker-October-2025-Release-Date-Christmas-2025-Set-Front-Box.jpg 847w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/LEGO-Star-Wars-40806-Gingerbread-AT-AT-Walker-October-2025-Release-Date-Christmas-2025-Set-Front-Box-298x300.jpg 298w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/LEGO-Star-Wars-40806-Gingerbread-AT-AT-Walker-October-2025-Release-Date-Christmas-2025-Set-Front-Box-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/LEGO-Star-Wars-40806-Gingerbread-AT-AT-Walker-October-2025-Release-Date-Christmas-2025-Set-Front-Box-768x773.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 847px) 100vw, 847px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-99912 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/LEGO-Star-Wars-40806-Gingerbread-AT-AT-Walker-October-2025-Release-Date-Christmas-2025-Set-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="846" height="855" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/LEGO-Star-Wars-40806-Gingerbread-AT-AT-Walker-October-2025-Release-Date-Christmas-2025-Set-Back-Box.jpg 846w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/LEGO-Star-Wars-40806-Gingerbread-AT-AT-Walker-October-2025-Release-Date-Christmas-2025-Set-Back-Box-297x300.jpg 297w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/LEGO-Star-Wars-40806-Gingerbread-AT-AT-Walker-October-2025-Release-Date-Christmas-2025-Set-Back-Box-768x776.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 846px) 100vw, 846px" /></p>
