		<item>
		<title>8 Best LEGO Sets for the Holidays and Christmas 2026 Under $100</title>
		<link>https://www.toysnbricks.com/8-best-lego-sets-for-the-holidays-and-christmas-2026-under-100/</link>
					<comments>https://www.toysnbricks.com/8-best-lego-sets-for-the-holidays-and-christmas-2026-under-100/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[News Reporter]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 18:24:32 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Editor's Picks]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[General]]></category>
