		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.toysnbricks.com/?p=114635</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1230" height="654" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/8-Best-LEGO-Sets-for-the-Holidays-and-Christmas-2026-Under-100-e1794502944429.png" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="8 Best LEGO Sets for the Holidays and Christmas 2026 Under $100" decoding="async" loading="lazy" /></p>
<p>The holiday season is right around the corner, and LEGO (USA &#124; Canada &#124; UK &#124; Australia) has</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/8-best-lego-sets-for-the-holidays-and-christmas-2026-under-100/">8 Best LEGO Sets for the Holidays and Christmas 2026 Under $100</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>The holiday season is right around the corner, and LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>) has a collection of sets that capture the holiday spirit that makes this time of year so special. While some are large and may not be the most budget-friendly, plenty of holiday and Christmas-themed sets won&#8217;t break the bank but are still incredibly fun to build and beautiful to display.</p>
<p>Let&#8217;s go over a few of the best LEGO sets for the holidays and Christmas 2026 that you can pick up right now at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>).</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<h2><span style="font-weight: 400;">1. Santa&#8217;s Holiday Countdown 40874 &#8211; $59.99</span></h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Buy LEGO at Official LEGO Site:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
<li><strong>Buy LEGO at Amazon:</strong> <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> | <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641">Amazon Canada</a> | <a href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx">Amazon UK</a></li>
<li><strong>Buy LEGO at eBay (Secondary Marketplace):</strong> <a href="https://www.ebay.com/sch/i.html?_nkw=lego&amp;_sacat=0&amp;_from=R40&amp;_sop=1&amp;mkcid=1&amp;mkrid=711-53200-19255-0&amp;siteid=0&amp;campid=5339120024&amp;customid=&amp;toolid=10001&amp;mkevt=1">eBay USA</a> | <a href="https://www.ebay.ca/sch/i.html?_nkw=lego&amp;_sacat=0&amp;_from=R40&amp;_sop=1&amp;mkcid=1&amp;mkrid=706-53473-19255-0&amp;siteid=2&amp;campid=5339120024&amp;customid=&amp;toolid=10001&amp;mkevt=1">eBay Canada</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-112326" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40874-Santas-Holiday-Countdown-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Seasonal-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="1200" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40874-Santas-Holiday-Countdown-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Seasonal-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40874-Santas-Holiday-Countdown-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Seasonal-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40874-Santas-Holiday-Countdown-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Seasonal-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40874-Santas-Holiday-Countdown-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Seasonal-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40874-Santas-Holiday-Countdown-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Seasonal-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p>This set lets you build a holiday countdown in the shape of a chimney, with Santa Claus emerging from the top and a bag of toys beside him. But in addition to just being a nice display piece, this set features a knob on the side of the chimney that lets you change the countdown date on the front with a simple twist.</p>
<p>This makes it an engaging and fun piece that ensures you always know just how many days until Christmas is here!</p>
<h2><span style="font-weight: 400;">2. Christmas Stocking 40958 &#8211; $34.99</span></h2>
<ul>
