<p>A stocking is a classic Christmas decoration, and this LEGO version is no different. This stunning set lets you create and design a beautiful and festive Christmas stocking, complete with small details like a candy cane, gingerbread tree, a Nutcracker minifigure, and more.</p>
<p>In addition to deciding which gifts to place in the stocking, you can also customize how it looks by adding holly leaves and golden stars to the design. Once it&#8217;s done, you can display the piece on a wall, hang it from your Christmas tree, or even set it beside your real stockings.</p>
