<p>Great for both displaying and playing with, Santa&#8217;s Holiday Sleigh Adventure is another Christmas-themed LEGO set worth checking out. It comes with the iconic Santa Claus and Mrs. Claus mini figures, three reindeer, and a sleigh that&#8217;s full of gifts.</p>
<p>The set is a relatively light and easy build that&#8217;s perfect for families with children, and you can display it on its own or add it to an even bigger LEGO Christmas display.</p>
