<p>Few things are as connected to Christmas as gingerbread houses are. This LEGO Festive Gingerbread House set comes with a Santa Claus minifigure, as well as plenty of festive details to decorate the exterior. But while the outside is great, the true magic appears when you open up the house. Doing so reveals a two-floor interior that includes Santa&#8217;s desk, a fireplace, a bedroom, and many other details.</p>
<h2><span style="font-weight: 400;">7. Up-Scaled Mrs. Claus Minifigure 40875 &#8211; $59.99</span></h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Buy LEGO at Official LEGO Site:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
<li><strong>Buy LEGO at Amazon:</strong> <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> | <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641">Amazon Canada</a> | <a href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx">Amazon UK</a></li>
<li><strong>Buy LEGO at eBay (Secondary Marketplace):</strong> <a href="https://www.ebay.com/sch/i.html?_nkw=lego&amp;_sacat=0&amp;_from=R40&amp;_sop=1&amp;mkcid=1&amp;mkrid=711-53200-19255-0&amp;siteid=0&amp;campid=5339120024&amp;customid=&amp;toolid=10001&amp;mkevt=1">eBay USA</a> | <a href="https://www.ebay.ca/sch/i.html?_nkw=lego&amp;_sacat=0&amp;_from=R40&amp;_sop=1&amp;mkcid=1&amp;mkrid=706-53473-19255-0&amp;siteid=2&amp;campid=5339120024&amp;customid=&amp;toolid=10001&amp;mkevt=1">eBay Canada</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-112335" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40875-Up-Scaled-Mrs.-Claus-Minifigure-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Seasonal-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="1200" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40875-Up-Scaled-Mrs.-Claus-Minifigure-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Seasonal-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40875-Up-Scaled-Mrs.-Claus-Minifigure-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Seasonal-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40875-Up-Scaled-Mrs.-Claus-Minifigure-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Seasonal-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40875-Up-Scaled-Mrs.-Claus-Minifigure-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Seasonal-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40875-Up-Scaled-Mrs.-Claus-Minifigure-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Seasonal-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p>This Up-Scaled Mrs. Claus minifigure makes a supersized addition to any holiday display. It&#8217;s a 6:1 scale model of the iconic character in her classic red dress, and you can move her arms, hands, and head to pose her any way you&#8217;d like. At over 900 pieces, it&#8217;s the largest set on this list, but is well worth the effort to add this eye-catching piece to your Christmas display.</p>
<h2><span style="font-weight: 400;">8. Buddy the Elf 40865 &#8211; $39.99</span></h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Buy LEGO at Official LEGO Site:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
<li><strong>Buy LEGO at Amazon:</strong> <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> | <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641">Amazon Canada</a> | <a href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx">Amazon UK</a></li>
<li><strong>Buy LEGO at eBay (Secondary Marketplace):</strong> <a href="https://www.ebay.com/sch/i.html?_nkw=lego&amp;_sacat=0&amp;_from=R40&amp;_sop=1&amp;mkcid=1&amp;mkrid=711-53200-19255-0&amp;siteid=0&amp;campid=5339120024&amp;customid=&amp;toolid=10001&amp;mkevt=1">eBay USA</a> | <a href="https://www.ebay.ca/sch/i.html?_nkw=lego&amp;_sacat=0&amp;_from=R40&amp;_sop=1&amp;mkcid=1&amp;mkrid=706-53473-19255-0&amp;siteid=2&amp;campid=5339120024&amp;customid=&amp;toolid=10001&amp;mkevt=1">eBay Canada</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-112322" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40865-Buddy-the-Elf-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Seasonal-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="1200" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40865-Buddy-the-Elf-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Seasonal-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40865-Buddy-the-Elf-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Seasonal-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40865-Buddy-the-Elf-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Seasonal-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40865-Buddy-the-Elf-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Seasonal-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40865-Buddy-the-Elf-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Seasonal-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p>Last but not least, we have the iconic Buddy the Elf from the legendary &#8220;Elf&#8221; film. Buddy stands on an ice-shaped base and is surrounded by many details fans of the movie will be familiar with, such as an Arctic puffin, a bottle of maple syrup, and candy canes. It&#8217;s a fairly tall piece and is sure to put a smile on the face of any Elf fan who sees your display.</p>
<p><strong>More LEGO reads at Toys N Bricks:</strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-news/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO News</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/legoland-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-reviews/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Reviews</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Deals</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-canada/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada LEGO Deals</a></p>
<p><strong>Visit our LEGO Forums:</strong> Where traditional and classic meets our <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Legacy LEGO Forums</a>. A library of LEGO resources and for members to ask questions. All articles posted on our main site at Toysnbricks.com are posted in the forums as well. The best part is that there are no ads in our LEGO forums. Registration for a basic forum account is free and fast.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113380 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="815" height="651" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg 999w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-300x240.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-768x613.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 815px) 100vw, 815px" /></p>
