					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1232" height="1151" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Seven-Upcoming-LEGO-Star-Wars-January-2027-Sets-Revealed-75495-75482-75480-75478-75470-75466-75467-Front-Box.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Seven Upcoming LEGO Star Wars January 2027 Sets Revealed (75495 75482 75480 75478 75470 75466 75467) Front Box" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Seven-Upcoming-LEGO-Star-Wars-January-2027-Sets-Revealed-75495-75482-75480-75478-75470-75466-75467-Front-Box.jpg 1232w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Seven-Upcoming-LEGO-Star-Wars-January-2027-Sets-Revealed-75495-75482-75480-75478-75470-75466-75467-Front-Box-300x280.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Seven-Upcoming-LEGO-Star-Wars-January-2027-Sets-Revealed-75495-75482-75480-75478-75470-75466-75467-Front-Box-1024x957.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Seven-Upcoming-LEGO-Star-Wars-January-2027-Sets-Revealed-75495-75482-75480-75478-75470-75466-75467-Front-Box-768x718.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1232px) 100vw, 1232px" /></p>
<p>Seven new Disney Lucasfilm LEGO Star Wars January 2027 sets have been revealed LEGO (USA &#124; Canada &#124; UK &#124; Australia). We&#8217;ll look at</p>
