					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="869" height="855" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76450-Book-Nook-Hogwarts-Express-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO Harry Potter 76450 Book Nook Hogwarts Express June 2025 Release Date Front Box" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76450-Book-Nook-Hogwarts-Express-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 869w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76450-Book-Nook-Hogwarts-Express-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x295.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76450-Book-Nook-Hogwarts-Express-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x756.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 869px) 100vw, 869px" /></p>
<p>Good Morning LEGO Fans! Amazon US currently has some LEGO deals for this morning. Free shipping on orders</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/5-handpicked-best-amazon-us-lego-deals-sales-list-for-this-morning-november-12-2026/">5 Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &#038; Sales List for This Morning, November 12, 2026 (50% off Harry Potter Book Nook &#038; More)</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Good Morning LEGO Fans! <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> currently has some LEGO deals for this morning. Free shipping on orders above $35. As always, prices can fluctuate at anytime.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-96577 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76450-Book-Nook-Hogwarts-Express-June-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="934" height="684" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76450-Book-Nook-Hogwarts-Express-June-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg 934w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76450-Book-Nook-Hogwarts-Express-June-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box-300x220.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76450-Book-Nook-Hogwarts-Express-June-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x562.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 934px) 100vw, 934px" /></p>
<p>My favorite deal would be the <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Harry-Potter-Book-Nook/dp/B0DRW7WRX3?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=30279c5ccbce5cd8058a43088a780c1b&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Harry Potter Book Nook: Hogwarts Express 76450</a> at 50% off for <strong>$50</strong> (reg.$99.99). Don&#8217;t wait too long though as this epic price will not last!</p>
<p>Below are 10 of our Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for Tonight, November 11, 2026. Be sure to subscribe to our email so you don’t miss out on any other LEGO Sales &amp; Deals happening in the USA!</p>
